                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Join @LeaderHoyer, @RosaDeLauro, @FrankPallone, @RepJahanaHayes, @SenStabenow & me at the U.S. Capitol for a press conference on two new bills to help parents find safe, affordable formula & ensure our babies get the nutrition they need. https://t.co/z9e70tUId2",
