                "text": "The @HouseDemocrats are also advancing the Ensuring Women\u2019s Right to Reproductive Freedom Act.\n\u00a0\nThis legislation will prevent the GOP from criminalizing, fining or suing women who exercise their Constitutionally protected right to travel across state lines to obtain an abortion.",
